      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>The Annual Revenue Requirement and Point-to-Point rates are filed in PJM OATT AttH-28. The Annual Revenue Requirement is allocated to a monthly revenue, and this monthly revenue along with Point-to-Point revenues are paid through PJM Interconnection, LLC.</p>
